        <mxCell id="18uyYAaJe0WN5ZO5eROU-17" value="virRegisterConnectDriver函数的第一个参数就是remote驱动中用于操作各种对象的函数集合：&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;virRegisterConnectDriver(&amp;amp;connect_driver,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;false) &amp;lt; 0)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;static virConnectDriver connect_driver = {&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; .hypervisorDriver = &amp;amp;hypervisor_driver,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; .interfaceDriver = &amp;amp;interface_driver,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; .networkDriver = &amp;amp;network_driver,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; .nodeDeviceDriver = &amp;amp;node_device_driver,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; .nwfilterDriver = &amp;amp;nwfilter_driver,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; .secretDriver = &amp;amp;secret_driver,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; .storageDriver = &amp;amp;storage_driver,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;};&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-207.5" y="570" width="275" height="200" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
